<title>NETHERLANDS: Heidemij Q3 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Heidemij Q3 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.36 vs   0.33</p>
<p>    Net profit			     6.6  vs   6.1</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    13.1  vs  11.3</p>
<p>Note - Dutch engineering consultancy Heidemij said in October it was in talks with sector rival DHV on a merger.</p>
</text>
